      "content": "Thanks, this is a good start. It definitely feels more professional than the raw notes. \n\nI just ran this through the preliminary scanner and the score was actually a bit lower than I expected for a \"high-level\" report. The director is really picky about the density of those specific terms for his initial triage—he expects a much stronger signal that we're looking at the big picture.\n\nCould you expand on this? Try to deepen the analysis of how these maritime moves affect the long-term power balance, but try to make sure the strategic weight of the text is much more apparent to the scanner. Again, don't just repeat the words for the sake of it, but the current version feels a little too \"light\" on the heavy-hitting terminology the director looks for.",
